{% set campus = false %}
{% from "modules/h1_requests/templates/_macros.html.j2" import signature %}
<p>{{ salutation(gender, first_name, last_name) }},</p>
<p>this is a reminder that the lease of your device <strong>{{ model }}</strong> (asset tag <strong>{{ asset_tag }}</strong>) ends on <strong>{{ retirement_date | date }}</strong> ({% if days_left > 0 %}{{ days_left }} days left{% elif days_left == 0 %}ends today{% else %}{{ -days_left }} days overdue{% endif %}). We have not received a replacement order yet.</p>
<p>Please order a replacement device via the ITSM portal. Once the order reaches us, we take care of the exchange and collect the old device.</p>
{% if campus %}<p>{% if campus %}As you work on the Campus, you can also bring the device to the Campus service point, or reply to this mail to arrange a desk visit.{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}
{{ signature(operator_name) }}
